SUMMARY:Explore Montclair's Walnut Street Neighborhood with Chow Town Food Tours
DESCRIPTION:Explore Montclair’s most delicious and historically significant neighborhoods on an immersive food tour that showcases the town’s culinary renaissance alongside oral histories of real residents\, present and past. \nThis incredible 3-hour walking tour of the best restaurants in the area has won rave reviews. What should you bring? Nothing but an appetite and a curious mind! This is our most popular tour\, for a reason. \nWhat’s included:\n-Hyper-local\, mobile chefs\n-Big and bold Jersey pizza\n-A beloved bakery and doughnut shop\n-A family-run craft brewery and social hub \nItinerary:\n-Neapolitan pizza\, Jersey style\n-An insider’s tour of the Montclair Farmer’s Market\n-Award-winning doughnuts\n-Secret gardens and hidden apiaries\n-Architectural highlights that reveal Montclair’s past\n-A former jazz club that is now multi-cultural bakery\n-Trivia\, games\, and more! \nHighlights:\n-Food tastings at four outstanding eateries\n-Local history and behind-the-scenes stories of the neighborhood\n-Expert tour guides\n-Guest appearances by neighborhood characters and big\, Jersey personalities\n-An easy route! Walnut Street is a simple\, flat route \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/explore-montclairs-walnut-street-neighborhood-with-chow-town-food-tours/
