DESCRIPTION:Three bands on the inside stage at the Porchistas house with the outdoor backyard open for mingling in between sets. This is a great show with a freeform lineup! \nMia Gutierrez Huang – Ween inspired weird folk to noise that moves to hard psycadelia in a flash – Playing on Jessica’s show on WFMU the day before. https://miagh.bandcamp.com/album/dispear\nSecret Monkey Weekend – https://secretmonkeyweekend.bandcamp.com/…/do-the… – touring from North Carolina – heavy on hooks\, absolutely infectious melodies\, and irrepressible attitude – featured in PBS documentary https://www.pbs.org/video/secret-monkey-weekend-ukc7h8/\nPillowinde – https://pillowinde.bandcamp.com/ genre hopping\, style moving\, killer band –\nflyer by Sage Barton\n$15 at the door cash or venmo \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
