SUMMARY:Garden State Roller Derby Double Header
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, October 3rd\, Garden State Roller Derby’s home teams face off for the title. Who will be the intraleague champion? \nDOUBLE HEADER \nGet TWO roller derby bouts for the price of one ticket. Our first game will feature local junior leagues. Ask us how your kids can get into roller derby! \nSchedule \nDoors open 5:30pm \nGame 1: First whistle – 6:00pm \nNew Jersey Roller Derby Juniors vs. NOVA Roller Derby Juniors \nGame 2: First whistle – 8:00pm \nNorthern Nightmares vs Gateway Grim Reapers \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
