SUMMARY:The Stylistics: An Unforgettable Night of Soul
DESCRIPTION:The Stylistics\, live with Herb Murrell\, Airrion Love & Jason Sharp! \nThe lights dim\, the anticipation rises\, and then—like a wave of pure soul—The Stylistics take the stage! With the legendary Herb Murrell and Airrion Love\, joined by the electrifying Jason Sharp\, the crowd erupts in applause\, knowing they are about to experience a night of timeless R&B magic. \nAs the first notes ring out\, the harmonies blend like silk\, sending chills through the audience. Their voices soar through classics like You Make Me Feel Brand New\, Betcha by Golly\, Wow\, and I’m Stone in Love with You\, each note dripping with the signature elegance and emotion that made The Stylistics icons. Backed by a lush\, full-band sound\, every melody is richer\, every lyric more heartfelt\, and every moment unforgettable. \nMurrell and Love’s legendary vocals intertwine with Sharp’s smooth and dynamic presence\, creating a perfect balance of nostalgia and fresh energy. The chemistry between them is undeniable—sharing stories\, engaging the crowd\, and delivering flawless performances that transport the audience through decades of love songs and soulful grooves. \nFrom slow\, candlelit ballads to upbeat\, dance-inducing hits\, the night is a celebration of pure musical artistry. As the final encore leaves the room buzzing with emotion\, the audience knows they’ve just witnessed something truly special—a performance where classic soul meets the heart and passion of today. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/the-stylistics-an-unforgettable-night-of-soul/
LOCATION:Wilkins Theatre\, 1000 Morris Ave\, Union\, NJ\, 07083\, United States
CATEGORIES:General Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/the-stylistics_update-Feb-2025-1-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Kean Stage":MAILTO:keanstage@kean.edu
END:VEVENT
