SUMMARY:Montclair Forum
DESCRIPTION:Step out from behind your screen and come meet your community in person.\nJoin us for the inaugural Montclair Forum — Where Cultures Connect\, a new community event bringing together people from Montclair and surrounding communities to connect\, share ideas\, have fun and learn from one another in a spirit of positivity.\nInspired by the ancient Roman Forum\, where people gathered to exchange ideas\, information and conversation\, Montclair Forum creates a place for something increasingly rare: genuine face-to-face connection.\nMontclair is home to people from a agreat variety of cultures and backgrounds\, and we want to celebrate them. Bring a food item or wear something that connects to your culture or country and come enjoy the wonderful diversity that makes Montclair\, Montclair.\nFree and open to everyone. RSVP requested \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
