SUMMARY:Montclair Music Club - Season Opening Concert - Oct. 5
DESCRIPTION:Announcing the Montclair Music Club 2026-‘27 Season Opening Concert\, Monday evening\, October 5th\, 7:30 pm\, Presbyterian Church of Upper Montclair\, 53 Norwood Avenue. You are invited to share in this season’s opener featuring the newly former Kintsugi Quintet performing the Prokofiev Quintet in G minor; coloratura soprano Karen Lundry with pianist Barry Spatz and actor Joseph Smith performing arias by Gounod and Bellini; lutist and guitarist Daryl Hester playing pieces by Ballard\, Galileia and Towner; and tenor Kristopher Jean\, with pianist Ryan Bridge\, singing works by Donizetti\, Lehar\, Ricky Ian Gordon and closing with Flaherty’s Make Them Hear You from Ragtime. Reception immediately following the program. Donations welcome. \nPlease share this announcement with family and friends. Enter the church on the east side of the building at the double doors. \nWe look forward to seeing you soon! \nMMC is a 501(c)(3) organization. You can renew your membership/join/donate at the registration desk or the website: https://montclairmusicclub.org/donate/ \nFollow on the MMC FB page: MontclairMusic Club – Home | Facebook and find program highlights at https://YouTube.com/@MontclairMusicClub \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/montclair-music-club-season-opening-concert-oct-5/
LOCATION:The Presbyterian Church of Upper Montclair\, 53 Norwood Avenue\, Upper Montclair\, NJ\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Montclair-Music-10.5.26-flyer-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Music Club":MAILTO:lpaparatto@gmail.com
